WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Step wide into Goddess with knees bent.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Reach one arm up and over.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Keep knees tracking.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Breathe into the side waist.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Switch sides.
